<p class="muted">Daily activity includes this cashier's transactions at this branch from 00:00 on {{ $report['date'] }} through {{ $report['cutoff'] }}. It includes earlier sessions on the same date. This is a saved closing snapshot; later activity is excluded.</p>
<h2>01 / Daily activity overview</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Invoices issued</th><th class="right">Invoice value</th><th class="right">Payment entries</th><th class="right">Net money collected</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="total"><td>{{ count($report['invoices']) }}</td><td class="right">{{ $money($report['invoice_total']) }}</td><td class="right">{{ count($report['payments']) }}</td><td class="right">{{ $money($report['net_collected']) }}</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p class="muted small">Invoice value and money collected are separate totals. Collections can include advances and payments for older invoices. Credit allocations are not money received.</p>
<h2>02 / Payment method summary — daily activity</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Payment method</th><th class="right">Entries</th><th class="right">Received / allocated</th><th class="right">Refund / credit reduction</th><th class="right">Net</th></tr></thead><tbody>@foreach($report['methods'] as $m)<tr><td>{{ $m['label'] }}</td><td class="right">{{ $m['count'] }}</td><td class="right">{{ $money($m['receipts']) }}</td><td class="right">{{ $money($m['refunds']) }}</td><td class="right">{{ $money($m['net']) }}</td></tr>@endforeach</tbody></table>
<h2>03 / Cash drawer reconciliation — this session only</h2><table><tbody>
<tr><td>Opening cash</td><td class="right">{{ $money($report['opening_cash']) }}</td></tr>
<tr><td>Net cash movement in this session</td><td class="right">{{ $money($report['expected_cash']-$report['opening_cash']) }}</td></tr>
<tr><td>Expected drawer cash</td><td class="right">{{ $money($report['expected_cash']) }}</td></tr>
<tr><td>Counted drawer cash</td><td class="right">{{ $money($report['counted_cash']) }}</td></tr>
<tr class="total"><td>{{ $report['variance'] < 0 ? 'Shortage' : ($report['variance'] > 0 ? 'Overage' : 'Balanced') }}</td><td class="right">{{ $money(abs($report['variance'])) }}</td></tr></tbody></table>
